# Cargo build output. Cargo.lock IS tracked on purpose: these are binaries, not
# a library, so a pinned dependency set is what makes a rebuild reproducible --
# and a stamp check is worthless if the same revision can build two different
# binaries.
rust/target/
rust/.port-report.md
rust/.warn-sign-port-report.md
